  "about": {
    "eyebrow": "About",
    "statement": "I design digital experiences with a visual storyteller's eye and a product designer's mindset.",
    "body": "My work sits at the intersection of product design, UX, visual craft, and AI assisted workflows. I create user focused products and intuitive experiences, shaped by my background in animation, composition, motion, and storytelling, using AI to explore ideas faster and push creative possibilities further."
  },
